#29856
Badge of Honor Halo~
0 m 500000
~
%load% obj 29812
say &09This year - we pay tribute to those who kindled the forge that became this realm.&00
wait 2 sec
kneel
wait 3 sec
say &09This time - we pay homage to those who paved the paths to the stars!&00
wait 2 sec
trium
wait 3 sec
say &09Now - NOW is the time we give back!&00
wait 2 sec
say &09NOW is the time we slay our enemies!&00
Wait 2 sec
say &09Take this token of appreciation for remembering those who do not have the opportunity to remember as we do!&00
wait 2 sec
%echo% &07a group of statues &00screams 'BANZAI!!!!' and brandishes their swords for battle.
wait 1 sec
give badge %actor.name%
~
